extends layout/main.pug

block head
  title #{title} | Preview Realtors

block content
  include mixins/navbar.pug 
  main#main
    +navbar('about')
    // ======= Intro Single =======
    section.intro-single.mt-5
      .container
        .row
          .col-md-12.col-lg-8
            .title-single-box
              h1.title-single Preview Realtors Ltd.
          .col-md-12.col-lg-4
            nav.breadcrumb-box.d-flex.justify-content-lg-end(aria-label='breadcrumb')
              ol.breadcrumb
                li.breadcrumb-item
                  a(href='/') Home
                li.breadcrumb-item.active(aria-current='page')
                  | About
    // End Intro Single
    // ======= About Section =======
    section.section-about
      .container
        .row
          .col-sm-12.position-relative
            .about-img-box
              img.img-fluid(src='http://res.cloudinary.com/upsurge-developers/image/upload/v1628142864/ucmjzclsdmfsy4mqhjll.jpg' alt='')
            .sinse-box
              h3.sinse-title
                | Preview Realtors
                span
                br
                |  Since 2009
              p Providing realtor services
          .col-md-12.section-t8.position-relative
            .row
              .col-md-6.col-lg-5
                img.img-fluid(src="http://res.cloudinary.com/upsurge-developers/image/upload/v1628228786/mnsn5iqz6d9ndzqboqe9.jpg" alt='')
              .col-md-6.col-lg-7.section-md-t3
                .title-box-d
                  h3.title-d(style="color:#111")
                    | About 
                    span.color-c Us
                p.color-text-c.bg-primary.p-4.border-curved
                  | Preview Realtors Limited is a real Estate Management agency firm of long standing. Since its inception and incorporation, It has strived to achieve client's satisfaction by offering top range professional services in the field of Estate Management and Estate Agency.
                  | We are registered with estate agent’s registration board.
                  | The company is dedicated to the delivery of quality Estate Management and Agency services with an emphasis on customer satisfaction to ensure our landlords sustained income and the tenant's pleasant accommodation, our services also include:
                  ul.color-text-c.bg-secondary.p-4.border-curved
                    li Pre and Post sales services
                    li Mortgage Arrangements
                    li Real Estate Advisory services
                    li Letting and Management Services
                p.color-text-c.bg-primary.p-4.border-curved
                  | Our mission is to provide quality timely services and add value to our customers (clients) by focusing on:
                  ul.color-text-c.bg-secondary.p-4.border-curved
                    li Reliability
                    li Integrity
                    li Quality
                    li Professionalism

          .col-md-12.section-t8.position-relative
            .row
              .col-md-6.col-lg-7.section-md-t3
                .title-box-d
                  h3.title-d(style="color:#111")
                    | Our 
                    span.color-c Profile
                p.color-text-c.bg-primary.p-4.border-curved
                  | Preview Realtors Ltd. currently manages over 35 Blocks of flats, apartments and commercial entities with a monthly rental receivable of over 25 Million per month.
                  | It has a dedicated and professionally trained staff. To ensure that we accomplish the desired services to our clients, we engage the relevant professionals in the fields of land valuation, land surveyors, legal staff and also employ staff who are registered with the estate agents’ registration board (EARB).
                .mt-5
                  h3(style="color:#111") Our 
                    span.color-c Scope 
                ul.text-center.mt-3.bg-secondary.color-text-c.border-curved.p-4
                  ul Property Sales
                  ul Letting of Properties
                  ul Leasing Administration
                  ul Rent Collection and Accounting
                  ul Management of Tenants
                  ul Management of building, maintenance and repair works
                  ul Rental Negotiations
                  ul Drawing up of lease documents 
                  ul Drawing up of sales agreements

              .col-md-6.col-lg-5
                img.img-fluid(src='http://res.cloudinary.com/upsurge-developers/image/upload/v1628228709/zbyxrobuba7yt43gmn5u.jpg' alt='')

          .col-md-12.section-t8.position-relative
            .row
              .col-md-12
                .title-wrap.d-flex.justify-content-between
                  .title-box
                    h2.title-a Who We Are
            .row 
              .col-md-6.col-lg-7 
                p.color-text-c.bg-primary.p-4.border-curved
                  | Preview Realtors Ltd has been in the real estate industry for the past 12 years, gaining experience in letting and management, pre and post sales, mortgages arrangements and real estate advisory services.
                  | Preview Realtors Ltd has built a solid foundation of clients through its professionalism, attention to details and commitment to always putting clients’ needs first.
                  | Preview Realtors Limited has created a team that is passionate about real estate, hard work, integrity and outstanding client service.
                hr
                h4 Our Mission
                p.color-text-c.bg-secondary.p-4.border-curved
                  | To give a high level of real estate representation,
                  | ensuring that properties are leased in an exemplary manner.
                  | We endeavor to deliver professional housing services to clients and customers so that transactions are completed to the satisfaction of all concerned
                hr
                h4 Our Vision
                p.color-text-c.bg-primary.p-4.border-curved
                  | To be the preferred property management provider worldwide
              .col-md-6.col-lg-5 
                img.img-fluid(src='http://res.cloudinary.com/upsurge-developers/image/upload/v1628145639/sud7tjbgzirplup5v0hz.jpg' alt='')
    .bg-secondary
      .container
        .col-md-12.section-t8.position-relative
          .row
            .col-md-12
              .title-wrap.d-flex.justify-content-between
                .title-box
                  h2.color-text-c Our Core Values 
          .row.pb-5
            .col-md-3 
              .card.text-center
                .card-body
                  i.bi.bi-check-circle.text-success.mb-5(style='font-size: 6rem')
                  h3.card-title.text-success Integrity
                  p.card-text
                  | We communicate openly, we are honest, trustworthy and transparent in our actions.
            .col-md-3 
              .card.text-center
                .card-body
                  i.bi.bi-people.text-primary.mb-5(style='font-size: 6rem')
                  h3.card-title.text-primary Team Work
                  p.card-text
                  | We work together to achieve our common goals and support each other to reach our target sales.
            .col-md-3 
              .card.text-center
                .card-body
                  i.bi.bi-award.text-warning.mb-5(style='font-size: 6rem')
                  h3.card-title.text-warning Prompt Delivery
                  p.card-text
                  | We quickly act and respond to client feedback and perform our duties without delay.
            .col-md-3 
              .card.text-center
                .card-body
                  i.bi.bi-card-checklist.text-info.mb-5(style='font-size: 6rem')
                  h3.card-title.text-info Versatility
                  p.card-text
                  | We are professional and high adaptable to the varied needs of our
                  br
                  | clients.
